#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:478
msgid ""
"Email-domain allowlist: accept submissions only from a chosen set of "
"domains."
msgstr ""
"Liste blanche de domaines e-mail : n’accepter que les envois provenant d’un "
"ensemble de domaines choisi."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:479
msgid ""
"Auto-updated disposable-email domain list, refreshed daily, with a manual "
"\"Refresh now\"."
msgstr ""
"Liste de domaines d’e-mail jetables mise à jour automatiquement chaque jour,"
" avec un bouton manuel « Actualiser maintenant »."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:480
msgid ""
"MX/DNS validation: reject addresses whose domain has no mail server (typos, "
"non-existent domains)."
msgstr ""
"Validation MX/DNS : rejeter les adresses dont le domaine n’a pas de serveur "
"de messagerie (fautes de frappe, domaines inexistants)."

#: includes/class-oliforge-cf7sg-settings.php:481
msgid ""
"Passed journal: a searchable, sortable log of submissions that passed every "
"check."
msgstr ""
"Journal des envois validés : un historique consultable et triable des envois"
" ayant réussi toutes les vérifications."

